        "comment": "[BSP reconstruction 00b6ed80]\nAssign node+170 scene reference. Detach old scene, reload after type callback, publish requested pointer before InterlockedIncrement(+4), decrement reloaded old reference and virtual+0 on zero, reload and register current scene. Recursive virtual+50 child dispatch uses original request; reload child+3C after callback. No transform cache writes. Scene+14 is cLight registry; ordinary c3dObject can attach without registration. Original ABI: __thiscall void(node ECX, scene*, recursion byte); RET 8 Evidence: docs/SCENE_NODE_ATTACHMENT.md; reports/scene_node_attachment_audit.json. Descriptive names are hypotheses; typed C++ interfaces are not native ABI or game validation."
      },
